# Project Goals

Installation cannot infer product intent safely. Use the five-question protocol in `{{OWNER_projectDiscovery}}` to replace this initialization status with a confirmed purpose, users, complete user outcomes, measurable success criteria, constraints, and non-goals.

If the user does not know an answer, offer evidence-based options, but keep the selected default labeled as an assumption until confirmed. Until that review happens, no product goal or capability is claimed by the workflow package. Preserve any intent already documented elsewhere and link it here rather than duplicating it.
